{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:05:46.109Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"c371ae3f034ec2d376f25dcb30356cc482811a47f54d1aed1dbbe8adb6c8fe54","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"@Ilse Varga The main contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She's the one who reported the duplicate arrivals on door 6 again. Dana mentioned it here on Aug 20 last year: it was the morning shift, and the same trailer showed up twice at 06:30 because the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand. Dana Okafor is the account manager on our side. (Don't mix it up with Quarendon Freightways, which isn't a customer.)","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130","thread_ts":"1791987000.000129"}}
{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:05:49.577Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"9cf7283dc4b2248bbde2556b621590d4fa47974c415a1d21eddc800e826d4dd0","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I've answered Ilse in a thread on her #north-team message. The main contact for the door 6 duplicate arrivals at Quarrendon Freight Lines is Thea Ramaswell, their Director of Yard Operations.\n\n- **Where it comes from:** The North team cheat sheet lists Thea as the account's main contact. In #north-team on Aug 20, 2025, Dana Okafor said Thea had flagged the door 6 duplicates again on the morning shift. The same trailer showed up twice at 06:30 because the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand.\n- **Other details in the reply:** Dana Okafor is the account manager on our side. I also warned against mixing it up with Quarendon Freightways, a similarly named company that isn't a customer.\n- **Left out:** That Aug 20 message also mentioned a change in seat count, but I didn't include it because it wasn't part of the question."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000131"}}
